<description>When Michelle sets Enrollment Status = Accepted: day 0 send the Accepted Student Outreach letter; day 1 send the E3 documents request; day 2 create a $100 Stripe checkout session (TEST mode account only: stripeGC__Is_Live_Mode__c = false), store the URL, set Stripe Payment Status = Pending and send the $100 Administrative Fee template, unless a Stripe link was already generated (manual Generate Stripe Payment Link) or the Opportunity is no longer Accepted. Each send is F0 gated.</description>
